# ── Rust ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
rust_lib/**/target/

# ── Unity Generated / Caches ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/[Ll]ibrary/
**/[Tt]emp/
**/[Ll]ogs/
**/[Uu]serSettings/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/.vs/

# Crash reports and memory dumps
**/MemoryCaptures/
**/Logs/

# ── Build Outputs (Scoped to avoid breaking Packages) 
# If your project has sub-projects, explicitly target their build outputs:
# PackageSandbox/[Bb]uild/ 

# ── Keep compiled native libs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
!packages/**/Plugins/Native/**/*.dll
!packages/**/Plugins/Native/**/*.dylib
!packages/**/Plugins/Native/**/*.so
!packages/**/Plugins/Native/**/*.a

# ── macOS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
*.swp
